# Keep every text file LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This matters more than usual here: the CI runs on Linux and macOS, and a
# Makefile checked out with CRLF line endings makes GNU Make pass the trailing
# carriage return to the shell, so `rm -f test_ir` silently tries to delete a
# file named "test_ir\r".
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
